# PMTwin Architecture Resolution

## Project Context

- B2B marketplace connecting Project Managers, consultants, and companies in Saudi Arabia
- **Active runtime:** `web/` (React SPA, command gateway, repositories)
- **Shared logic:** `packages/` (`lifecycle`, `commands`, `matching`)
- **POC/:** Legacy reference, seed source (`POC/data/`), scripts, regression harness — **frozen for new product logic**
- Target: SaaS-ready platform serving 100,000+ concurrent users
- Architecture authority chain: Domain Blueprint → Command Architecture → Unified Lifecycle Engine → This sprint
- Runtime ownership: see `docs/runtime-ownership.md`

## Critical Constraints

1. NEVER implement backend logic in POC/ folder — POC is legacy reference only (Phase 10.3 freeze)
2. NEVER import TypeScript from web/ into POC/ or JavaScript from POC/ into web/
3. NEVER import POC/src from web/ — seed JSON only via @seed-data alias
4. ALL lifecycle state names MUST come from @pm-twin/lifecycle registry (manifest.json)
5. ALL new product behavior MUST go through web command gateway + packages/* — not POC/src
6. Web persistence: repositories → pmtwin_web_overrides (not POC data-service.js)
7. ALL new code must pass: lint → type-check → unit test → build

## File Authority Matrix

| Path | Authority | Can Import From |
|------|-----------|-----------------|
| packages/lifecycle/ | SOURCE OF TRUTH | Nothing (zero-dependency) |
| packages/commands/ | Command contracts | packages/lifecycle (types only) |
| packages/matching/ | Matching engine | packages/lifecycle (if needed) |
| web/src/ | **Active runtime** | packages/*, @seed-data (JSON only), node_modules |
| POC/data/ | Physical seed source | N/A (static JSON) |
| POC/src/ | Legacy (frozen — no new product logic) | packages/lifecycle/ (static serve only) |
| POC/scripts/ | Seed/harness tooling | POC/data, packages (optional) |
| docs/adr/ | Immutable after approval | Nothing |
